## Day 1 - SQL Practice


Ques Big Countries (SQL Leetcode 50)


-> We have given a table which consist of name, continent, area, population and gdp value 

-> We have to find big countries name, area and population 

-> A country is called big country if
     - area at least 3 million or 
     - population at least 25million 



```sql
select name,population,area from world where area >= 3000000 and population>=25000000
```
